1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:01,704
Kip: Okay.

2
00:00:01,704 --> 00:00:03,095
Why is everyone staring at the

3
00:00:03,095 --> 00:00:04,167
sign above my head?

4
00:00:04,217 --> 00:00:04,639
Kip: No, no,

5
00:00:04,639 --> 00:00:05,151
no, no...

6
00:00:05,151 --> 00:00:06,142
don't load.

7
00:00:06,142 --> 00:00:06,836
DON'T LOAD!

8
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:14,137
Narrator: That morning,

9
00:00:14,137 --> 00:00:15,745
nobody in town knew what was

10
00:00:15,745 --> 00:00:17,345
about to happen...

11
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:20,643
Kip: Morning, world!

12
00:00:20,643 --> 00:00:21,692
Today is going to be a

13
00:00:21,692 --> 00:00:23,208
totally normal day.

14
00:00:23,471 --> 00:00:24,316
Max: KIP!

15
00:00:24,316 --> 00:00:25,870
Open the window!

16
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:26,910
Something is very,

17
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:28,150
very wrong!

18
00:00:28,413 --> 00:00:29,287
Kip: Max?

19
00:00:29,287 --> 00:00:31,327
What's that glowing thing above your head?

20
00:00:31,591 --> 00:00:32,944
Max: Don't read it!

21
00:00:32,944 --> 00:00:34,603
Do NOT read it!

22
00:00:34,866 --> 00:00:36,094
Kip: "I still sleep with a teddy

23
00:00:36,094 --> 00:00:37,109
bear named...

24
00:00:37,109 --> 00:00:38,064
Mr.

25
00:00:38,064 --> 00:00:39,243
Fluffles"?

26
00:00:39,506 --> 00:00:41,116
Max: It's not funny!

27
00:00:43,885 --> 00:00:44,921
Kip: Mister...

28
00:00:44,921 --> 00:00:45,903
Fluffles!

29
00:00:45,903 --> 00:00:46,830
That is the best thing I

30
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,044
have ever heard!

31
00:00:48,307 --> 00:00:50,011
Max: Everybody has one!

32
00:00:50,011 --> 00:00:51,236
The whole town woke up with

33
00:00:51,236 --> 00:00:53,926
their biggest secret floating over their heads!

34
00:00:54,189 --> 00:00:55,001
Kip: Wait.

35
00:00:55,001 --> 00:00:56,013
Everybody?

36
00:00:56,013 --> 00:00:57,609
Then why don't I have one?

37
00:00:57,873 --> 00:01:00,375
Max: Maybe your secrets are just boring.

38
00:01:00,639 --> 00:01:01,790
Kip: Or maybe I am a person

39
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:03,620
with no secrets at all.

40
00:01:03,883 --> 00:01:04,681
Mom: Kip!

41
00:01:04,681 --> 00:01:05,694
Breakfast!

42
00:01:05,694 --> 00:01:06,983
And... please do not look above

43
00:01:06,983 --> 00:01:08,004
my head.

44
00:01:08,268 --> 00:01:09,416
Kip: Relax, Mom.

45
00:01:09,416 --> 00:01:10,839
You don't even have one.

46
00:01:10,839 --> 00:01:12,313
It just says 'loading'.

47
00:01:12,577 --> 00:01:14,065
Mom: Oh, thank goodness.

48
00:01:14,065 --> 00:01:14,625
I mean...

49
00:01:14,625 --> 00:01:15,711
how strange!

50
00:01:15,711 --> 00:01:17,615
Must be a very slow sign.

51
00:01:17,878 --> 00:01:20,265
Max: Your mom is acting super weird.

52
00:01:20,528 --> 00:01:21,949
Kip: Moms are always weird.

53
00:01:21,949 --> 00:01:22,859
Come on!

54
00:01:22,859 --> 00:01:24,359
Let's go see the town!

55
00:01:25,336 --> 00:01:26,982
Rosa: Good morning, boys!

56
00:01:26,982 --> 00:01:28,745
Fresh homemade cookies!

57
00:01:28,745 --> 00:01:30,262
Baked with love!

58
00:01:30,525 --> 00:01:33,296
Kip: "My homemade cookies are from the supermarket"?

59
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,721
Rosa: That sign is a liar! ...Mostly.

60
00:01:35,721 --> 00:01:37,842
Okay, it's a little bit true.

61
00:01:38,106 --> 00:01:39,743
Officer Dan: Move along, kids.

62
00:01:39,743 --> 00:01:41,385
Nothing to see here.

63
00:01:41,385 --> 00:01:43,684
Everything is under control.

64
00:01:43,947 --> 00:01:46,081
Max: "I'm terrified of pigeons"?

65
00:01:48,651 --> 00:01:49,530
Officer Dan: AAAH!

66
00:01:49,530 --> 00:01:50,658
Get it off!

67
00:01:50,658 --> 00:01:52,112
Get it off me!

68
00:01:52,112 --> 00:01:53,457
It is looking at me with

69
00:01:53,457 --> 00:01:54,913
its tiny eyes!

70
00:01:55,177 --> 00:01:56,716
Kip: This is the best day ever!

71
00:01:56,716 --> 00:01:58,902
I should take pictures of EVERYBODY!

72
00:01:59,166 --> 00:02:00,720
Max: Kip... maybe don't.

73
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,986
People look really embarrassed.

74
00:02:03,250 --> 00:02:04,169
Kip: Relax!

75
00:02:04,169 --> 00:02:05,443
It's just a joke.

76
00:02:05,443 --> 00:02:07,637
Who cares about a few silly secrets?

77
00:02:10,006 --> 00:02:11,194
Kip: And... posted!

78
00:02:11,194 --> 00:02:12,425
The class group chat is going

79
00:02:12,425 --> 00:02:13,609
to LOVE this.

80
00:02:13,872 --> 00:02:14,789
Max: Wait.

81
00:02:14,789 --> 00:02:16,986
Which pictures did you post?

82
00:02:17,250 --> 00:02:18,585
Kip: Just the funny ones.

83
00:02:18,585 --> 00:02:19,791
Rosa, Officer Dan...

84
00:02:19,791 --> 00:02:21,862
and one tiny picture of Mr.

85
00:02:21,862 --> 00:02:22,987
Fluffles.

86
00:02:23,251 --> 00:02:24,246
Max: KIP!

87
00:02:25,223 --> 00:02:26,406
Mr. Grumbold: Silence!

88
00:02:26,406 --> 00:02:28,116
Eyes on the board!

89
00:02:28,116 --> 00:02:29,594
We will NOT be discussing the

90
00:02:29,594 --> 00:02:30,868
signs today.

91
00:02:31,131 --> 00:02:33,612
Max: Everybody in the hallway called me Mr.

92
00:02:33,612 --> 00:02:34,699
Fluffles.

93
00:02:34,699 --> 00:02:36,450
Fourteen times.

94
00:02:36,713 --> 00:02:37,833
Kip: Come on, Max.

95
00:02:37,833 --> 00:02:40,091
In a week nobody will even remember.

96
00:02:40,354 --> 00:02:42,029
Max: Easy for you to say.

97
00:02:42,029 --> 00:02:43,749
You don't have a sign.

98
00:02:44,012 --> 00:02:44,967
Kip: Mr.

99
00:02:44,967 --> 00:02:46,297
Grumbold... is it true you sing

100
00:02:46,297 --> 00:02:47,883
opera in the shower?

101
00:02:48,146 --> 00:02:49,840
Mr. Grumbold: Absolutely not!

102
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,774
I would never!

103
00:02:50,774 --> 00:02:51,999
...Every morning.

104
00:02:51,999 --> 00:02:53,231
Fine.

105
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,282
Mr. Grumbold: Ahem.

106
00:02:57,282 --> 00:02:58,774
Moving on!

107
00:02:59,037 --> 00:03:00,524
Kip: Ooh, and Lily the perfect class

108
00:03:00,524 --> 00:03:02,108
president has one too!

109
00:03:02,108 --> 00:03:03,232
Let me guess...

110
00:03:03,232 --> 00:03:04,930
"I once got a B-plus"?

111
00:03:07,099 --> 00:03:09,016
Kip: "I've never had a real friend."

112
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,407
Lily: Go ahead.

113
00:03:10,407 --> 00:03:11,169
Laugh.

114
00:03:11,169 --> 00:03:13,291
Everybody else already did.

115
00:03:13,555 --> 00:03:14,423
Kip: I...

116
00:03:14,423 --> 00:03:15,430
I wasn't going to laugh at

117
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,414
that one.

118
00:03:16,677 --> 00:03:19,042
Lily: People think perfect means happy.

119
00:03:19,042 --> 00:03:20,278
It doesn't.

120
00:03:20,278 --> 00:03:22,002
It just means nobody sits next

121
00:03:22,002 --> 00:03:23,115
to you.

122
00:03:23,379 --> 00:03:24,549
Max: You can sit next to us

123
00:03:24,549 --> 00:03:25,796
at lunch, Lily.

124
00:03:25,796 --> 00:03:27,246
If you want.

125
00:03:27,509 --> 00:03:29,410
Lily: Really? ...Thanks, Max.

126
00:03:32,693 --> 00:03:34,266
Lily: Kip... your sign.

127
00:03:34,266 --> 00:03:36,220
It is starting to load.

128
00:03:36,483 --> 00:03:37,282
Kip: What?

129
00:03:37,282 --> 00:03:38,054
No!

130
00:03:38,054 --> 00:03:39,400
That is impossible!

131
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,924
I have no secrets!

132
00:03:41,187 --> 00:03:41,983
Kip: Quick!

133
00:03:41,983 --> 00:03:43,455
Somebody give me a hat!

134
00:03:43,455 --> 00:03:44,448
A bucket!

135
00:03:44,448 --> 00:03:46,161
A really big sandwich!

136
00:03:46,425 --> 00:03:47,971
Mr. Grumbold: Kip, sit down.

137
00:03:47,971 --> 00:03:49,954
Signs cannot be covered.

138
00:03:49,954 --> 00:03:51,506
Science says.

139
00:03:54,675 --> 00:03:56,372
Max: "We're moving away on Friday...

140
00:03:56,372 --> 00:03:58,263
and I haven't told Max"?

141
00:03:58,526 --> 00:04:00,139
Kip: Max, I can explain...

142
00:04:00,403 --> 00:04:01,612
Max: You're MOVING?

143
00:04:01,612 --> 00:04:03,168
Like, away away?

144
00:04:03,168 --> 00:04:05,269
When were you going to tell me?

145
00:04:05,532 --> 00:04:06,771
Kip: I didn't know how.

146
00:04:06,771 --> 00:04:07,760
Every time I tried,

147
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:08,653
the words just...

148
00:04:08,653 --> 00:04:09,771
got stuck.

149
00:04:10,034 --> 00:04:12,223
Max: You laughed at my secret all day.

150
00:04:12,223 --> 00:04:13,109
And the whole time,

151
00:04:13,109 --> 00:04:14,601
you were hiding THIS?

152
00:04:14,864 --> 00:04:16,080
Kip: Max, wait!

153
00:04:18,849 --> 00:04:20,842
Lily: He just needs time, Kip.

154
00:04:20,842 --> 00:04:22,478
Secrets hurt more when they come

155
00:04:22,478 --> 00:04:23,961
out by accident.

156
00:04:24,938 --> 00:04:26,798
Kip: Mom... everybody saw my sign.

157
00:04:26,798 --> 00:04:28,473
And now Max hates me.

158
00:04:28,736 --> 00:04:30,009
Mom: Oh, sweetheart.

159
00:04:30,009 --> 00:04:30,960
Come here.

160
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:33,153
I'm so sorry it happened like that.

161
00:04:33,416 --> 00:04:34,228
Kip: Wait.

162
00:04:34,228 --> 00:04:35,877
Mom... you have a sign too.

163
00:04:35,877 --> 00:04:37,450
It's loading right now.

164
00:04:37,713 --> 00:04:38,595
Mom: Oh no.

165
00:04:38,595 --> 00:04:39,645
Not yet!

166
00:04:39,645 --> 00:04:41,718
It was supposed to be a surprise!

167
00:04:44,287 --> 00:04:45,874
Kip: "I turned down the new job.

168
00:04:45,874 --> 00:04:47,197
We're not moving"?

169
00:04:47,461 --> 00:04:49,244
Mom: I was going to tell you tonight.

170
00:04:49,244 --> 00:04:50,338
With pizza.

171
00:04:50,338 --> 00:04:52,314
And a cake that said 'We're staying.'

172
00:04:52,577 --> 00:04:53,607
Kip: We're STAYING?

173
00:04:53,607 --> 00:04:54,982
We're really staying?!

174
00:04:55,245 --> 00:04:56,987
Mom: Your whole life is here, Kip.

175
00:04:56,987 --> 00:04:57,985
Your school.

176
00:04:57,985 --> 00:04:59,063
Your friends.

177
00:04:59,063 --> 00:05:00,106
Max.

178
00:05:00,370 --> 00:05:01,344
Kip: But why did you keep it

179
00:05:01,344 --> 00:05:02,351
a secret?

180
00:05:02,615 --> 00:05:03,923
Mom: I didn't want to promise you

181
00:05:03,923 --> 00:05:05,701
something until I was sure.

182
00:05:05,701 --> 00:05:07,358
Some secrets are just good news

183
00:05:07,358 --> 00:05:09,556
waiting for the right moment.

184
00:05:09,819 --> 00:05:11,196
Kip: And mine was bad news waiting

185
00:05:11,196 --> 00:05:12,829
for the wrong moment.

186
00:05:13,092 --> 00:05:14,698
Mom: Then go make it right.

187
00:05:14,698 --> 00:05:16,443
The biggest secrets always take the

188
00:05:16,443 --> 00:05:17,860
longest to say.

189
00:05:18,123 --> 00:05:18,998
Kip: Max!

190
00:05:18,998 --> 00:05:20,743
I have to tell him right now!

191
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,621
Lily: Kip!

192
00:05:22,621 --> 00:05:23,924
Kip, stop!

193
00:05:23,924 --> 00:05:25,849
Max's sign changed!

194
00:05:25,849 --> 00:05:27,679
It's a NEW secret!

195
00:05:27,942 --> 00:05:29,409
Kip: Signs can change?

196
00:05:29,673 --> 00:05:31,459
Lily: When your biggest secret changes,

197
00:05:31,459 --> 00:05:33,101
your sign changes too.

198
00:05:33,101 --> 00:05:35,509
Look at the picture Rosa sent!

199
00:05:35,772 --> 00:05:37,775
Kip: "I'm leaving for the whole summer tonight.

200
00:05:37,775 --> 00:05:39,136
No goodbyes."

201
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,725
Lily: His bus leaves at six o'clock.

202
00:05:41,725 --> 00:05:43,657
It's five fifty-one!

203
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,890
Kip: Then we run.

204
00:05:44,890 --> 00:05:45,995
RIGHT NOW!

205
00:05:49,678 --> 00:05:50,584
Rosa: Kip!

206
00:05:50,584 --> 00:05:51,910
Need a ride?

207
00:05:51,910 --> 00:05:53,443
My delivery bike is faster than

208
00:05:53,443 --> 00:05:54,558
it looks!

209
00:05:54,821 --> 00:05:56,292
Kip: Rosa, you are the best!

210
00:05:56,292 --> 00:05:58,235
Even with supermarket cookies!

211
00:06:01,405 --> 00:06:02,303
Officer Dan: Halt!

212
00:06:02,303 --> 00:06:03,634
Road closed!

213
00:06:03,634 --> 00:06:06,009
Giant flock of pigeons ahead!

214
00:06:06,273 --> 00:06:06,909
Kip: Officer Dan,

215
00:06:06,909 --> 00:06:08,530
my best friend is leaving!

216
00:06:08,530 --> 00:06:09,523
Please!

217
00:06:09,787 --> 00:06:11,441
Officer Dan: ...For a best friend?

218
00:06:11,441 --> 00:06:12,303
Fine.

219
00:06:12,303 --> 00:06:14,033
I'll face my fears.

220
00:06:14,033 --> 00:06:14,894
Go!

221
00:06:14,894 --> 00:06:15,905
GO!

222
00:06:18,874 --> 00:06:19,840
Mr. Grumbold: Kip!

223
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,076
Running in the street?!

224
00:06:21,076 --> 00:06:22,204
...For a friend?

225
00:06:22,204 --> 00:06:23,454
Then RUN!

226
00:06:23,454 --> 00:06:25,911
I shall sing you a victory song!

227
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:30,190
Lily: Five fifty-nine!

228
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:32,223
We're not going to make it!

229
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,320
Bus Driver: Last call!

230
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,684
Doors closing!

231
00:06:35,684 --> 00:06:37,695
Please don't look at my sign!

232
00:06:37,958 --> 00:06:38,832
Kip: MAX!

233
00:06:38,832 --> 00:06:39,806
WAIT!

234
00:06:40,069 --> 00:06:40,914
Max: Kip?

235
00:06:40,914 --> 00:06:42,744
What are you doing here?

236
00:06:43,008 --> 00:06:44,109
Kip: We're not moving!

237
00:06:44,109 --> 00:06:45,694
Mom turned down the job!

238
00:06:45,694 --> 00:06:46,871
I'm staying!

239
00:06:47,134 --> 00:06:48,344
Max: That's great.

240
00:06:48,344 --> 00:06:49,371
Really.

241
00:06:49,371 --> 00:06:51,102
But you still laughed at me.

242
00:06:51,102 --> 00:06:52,836
In front of everyone.

243
00:06:53,099 --> 00:06:53,987
Kip: I know.

244
00:06:53,987 --> 00:06:55,094
And I'm sorry.

245
00:06:55,094 --> 00:06:56,594
I thought secrets were funny...

246
00:06:56,594 --> 00:06:58,192
until mine showed up.

247
00:07:01,161 --> 00:07:01,873
Max: Your sign...

248
00:07:01,873 --> 00:07:02,930
it changed.

249
00:07:02,930 --> 00:07:04,499
"Max is my best friend and

250
00:07:04,499 --> 00:07:06,091
I'm sorry I laughed."

251
00:07:06,355 --> 00:07:08,577
Kip: Turns out that's my biggest secret now.

252
00:07:08,577 --> 00:07:10,552
I just never said it out loud.

253
00:07:10,815 --> 00:07:12,439
Max: That's the worst secret I've seen

254
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:13,545
all day.

255
00:07:13,808 --> 00:07:16,034
Max: ...It's also the nicest one.

256
00:07:16,298 --> 00:07:17,902
Bus Driver: So... is anybody getting on this

257
00:07:17,902 --> 00:07:19,205
bus, or not?

258
00:07:19,469 --> 00:07:21,304
Max: I'll take the morning bus.

259
00:07:21,304 --> 00:07:23,907
And I'll say goodbye properly this time.

260
00:07:26,876 --> 00:07:28,783
Lily: Can I join the group hug?

261
00:07:28,783 --> 00:07:30,663
I have never been in one.

262
00:07:30,927 --> 00:07:32,206
Kip: Get in here, Lily!

263
00:07:34,975 --> 00:07:35,891
Max: Lily!

264
00:07:35,891 --> 00:07:37,963
Your sign changed too!

265
00:07:38,226 --> 00:07:41,071
Lily: "I have two real friends now." ...Okay.

266
00:07:41,071 --> 00:07:43,519
I am definitely going to cry.

267
00:07:43,782 --> 00:07:45,242
Bus Driver: Me too, honestly.

268
00:07:45,242 --> 00:07:46,591
Also, I really need to learn

269
00:07:46,591 --> 00:07:48,426
how to drive this thing.

270
00:07:49,403 --> 00:07:50,486
Kip: Morning, mirror!

271
00:07:50,486 --> 00:07:51,502
No sign.

272
00:07:51,502 --> 00:07:52,703
No secrets.

273
00:07:52,703 --> 00:07:54,000
Totally normal.

274
00:07:54,264 --> 00:07:55,962
Max: Mine's gone too!

275
00:07:55,962 --> 00:07:58,259
And look who came to say goodbye.

276
00:07:58,523 --> 00:07:59,751
Kip: Mister Fluffles!

277
00:07:59,751 --> 00:08:01,550
Nice to finally meet you.

278
00:08:04,719 --> 00:08:06,317
Kip: "I... can... talk"?!

279
00:08:08,486 --> 00:08:09,330
Kip: Nope!

280
00:08:09,330 --> 00:08:10,173
Nope!

281
00:08:10,173 --> 00:08:11,728
I'm going back to bed!

282
00:08:11,991 --> 00:08:14,005
Kip: So... what would YOUR biggest secret say?

283
00:08:14,005 --> 00:08:15,097
Don't tell me.

284
00:08:15,097 --> 00:08:16,440
Tell the comments.

285
00:08:17,416 --> 00:08:18,087
Narrator: Next time:

286
00:08:18,087 --> 00:08:19,499
What if you could live one

287
00:08:19,499 --> 00:08:21,450
day... as your best friend?
